SUMMARY:Gallery Hop
DESCRIPTION:Friday\, September 11\n5-7pm \nBegin the weekend celebration by touring participating galleries in the village of Nashville. The Art Guild will showcase a new Founders Exhibition along with striking artwork by its current artist members. Live painting by Art Guild Members in the Guild galleries\, music & refreshments. The Brown County Craft Guild\, Hoosier Artist Gallery & Spears Gallery will also offer unique and exquisite items for sale. Free & open to the public.
URL:https://browncountyartguild.org/event/gallery-hop/
CATEGORIES:Event
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncountyartguild.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/acw_gallery_hop_web_event.jpg
END:VEVENT
