SUMMARY:Art Colony Weekend - Community Paint Together
DESCRIPTION:12 – 4 pm\nVillage Green\, Main & Jefferson \nFree and open to the public \nThe Artist Associates of Brown County proudly presents the opportunity for everyone to take up a brush – young and old\, novice and experienced. Families are welcome. The canvas will await those who want to make their mark on this year’s masterpiece. A creation like no other\, the project aims to encourage the imaginative spirit and hidden talent within all of us.
URL:https://browncountyartguild.org/event/art-colony-weekend-community-paint-together/
CATEGORIES:Event
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://browncountyartguild.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/commpaint.png
END:VEVENT
